ame": "AstroQuest", "keywords": ["Space", "Planetarium", "Astronomy", "Stars", "Travel"], "long_description": "Everyone can become an astronaut and embark on an **exciting space journey**. Explore the wonders of the solar system, from the Sun to distant Neptune\u2014all from the comfort of your couch. \n\nWith its simple and minimalist interface, AstroQuest is designed for both professionals and kids, making space exploration accessible to everyone. Virtually visit your favorite celestial objects and float through space, immersing yourself in the awe of worlds where humans are yet to set foot.\n\n**AstroQuest Features:**\n* An intuitive, minimalist user interface for both professionals and kids\n* Interactive celestial paths of planets, moons, and asteroids\n* Fascinating facts about celestial objects\n* Time dilation to represent days, months, and years in space\n* Travel based on the shortest orbital path\n\n{1666359040897989}", "short_description": "AstroQuest lets everyone become an astronaut and embark on an exciting space journey. Explore the wonders of the solar system, from the Sun to distant Neptune, and even experience time travel\u2014all from the comfort of your couch. \n\nWith its simple and minimalist interface, AstroQuest is designed for both professionals and kids, making space exploration accessible to all. Virtually visit your favorite celestial object and immerse yourself in the awe of the cosmos.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://astroquest.ai/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sahithya Srinivasan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://astroquest.ai/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": []